MONL4,	TAD DIN		/ ANY CHARS IN THE BUFFER?
	CIA
	TAD DOUT
	SZA CLA
	JMP I (BUFOUT	/ PRT A PHONE BUFF CHAR

/ IF 'FILFLG'=1 THEN FILE-TO-PHONE I/O IS ACTIVE.
/ GO TRANSFER ANOTHER CHAR FROM FILE.

	TAD FILFLG
	SZA CLA
	JMP I (FIL2PH	/ SORT OF A CO-ROUTINE ??

