/ ROUTINE TO BRING IN A DEV HNDLR.  HNDLR
/ IS PLACED IN LOCS 2400-2777 OF FIELD 0.

K2401,	2401	/ FCW WORD
CALDEV,	0
	DCA CHAR	/ SAVE DEV NR
	TAD K2401
	DCA LOADPT
	TAD CHAR
	CIF 10
	JMS I K200	/ TO USR VIA 0200
	1		/ FETCH (DEV NR IN AC)
LOADPT,	2401		/ ARG(1)
	JMP NODEV	/ DEVICE NOT FOUND
	TAD LOADPT	/ GET ENTRY ADDR
	DCA DEVENT
	JMP I CALDEV

NODEV,	JMS I [TTYMSG
	NOHAN
	JMP I [MONLUP
/
/
/ PRINT A CHAR FROM PHONE BUFF AT THE TTY THEN RETURN
